<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon shares suspended due to technical problems.</title>
<headline>Lisbon shares suspended due to technical problems.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in cash shares on the Lisbon Continuous Market was interrupted from 1047 GMT due to technical problems, a bourse official said.</p>
<p>It was not known when trade would resume.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
